    <string name="wellness_title">Sleep and recovery</string>
    <string name="wellness_short">Sleep</string>
    <string name="wellness_empty">No sleep or recovery data yet. It comes from Garmin with your personal key, on every sync.</string>
    <string name="wellness_days">Day by day</string>
    <string name="wellness_source_note">From Garmin, as it works them out from the watch. The sleep stages come from movement and heart rate; the sleep score and Body Battery are Garmin\'s own estimates (by Firstbeat), whose formulas aren\'t published.</string>
    <string name="wellness_hypnogram_caption">Each bar is a stretch of the night in one stage, its row says which: awake at the top, deep sleep at the bottom. Time runs left to right, from falling asleep to waking.</string>
    <string name="wellness_hypnogram_description">Sleep stages from %1$s to %2$s</string>
    <string name="wellness_stages_unconfirmed">The stage timeline doesn\'t add up to Garmin\'s totals for each stage, so the stage names may be read wrong here. The totals below are Garmin\'s.</string>
    <string name="wellness_no_timeline">Garmin gave the totals for this night but no timeline.</string>
