    <string name="wellness_settings_title">Sleep and recovery</string>
    <string name="wellness_settings_intro">With the same key, each sync also brings sleep (with its stages), overnight HRV, resting heart rate, Body Battery, stress, steps and VO2max. Garmin\'s answers are kept on the phone as they came, and the days are read from them.</string>
    <string name="wellness_history">How far back</string>
    <string name="wellness_history_days">%1$d days</string>
    <string name="wellness_history_hint">About three requests a day the first time, a little apart; a long history takes a few minutes and goes on over several syncs if Garmin asks to slow down.</string>
    <string name="wellness_missing_fields">Looked for but not in Garmin\'s latest answer (see the data explorer): %1$s</string>
    <string name="wellness_clear">Delete the downloaded sleep and recovery data</string>
    <string name="garmin_error_rate">Garmin asked to slow down (too many requests).</string>
    <string name="explorer_title">Data explorer</string>
    <string name="explorer_intro">Ask Garmin for one kind of data and see its answer as it is: what Flownics reads from it, the shape of every field, and the text itself. Nothing here is saved unless you save it to a file.</string>
